# Paths exempt from bin/vendormark, one glob per line.
#
# This repo holds the history scrubber. Its rule files cannot do their work
# without spelling the strings they remove — a mailmap that rewrites a
# generator bot's address has to contain that address. The scripts that
# compile those rules are in the same position.
#
# This is the one honest case the escape hatch exists for. Anything else
# reaching for this file is about to ship the mark.
tools/rules/*
tools/git-hygiene.py
tools/git-hygiene-org.py
